<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Kesko raised at CSFB.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Kesko raised at CSFB.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish wholesale and retail group Kesko Oy was raised to &quot;buy&quot; at CS First Boston, the investment bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>CSFB said the European Union's approval for its unwinding of last year's merger with rival Tuko removed risks associated with the stock, adding that it looked undervaued compared with its peers.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
